! Every op of retro-words, over buffers chosen to reach the corners: case
! runs, punctuation, a wrapped word, a long run, and a one-word buffer.
! Separator rows 7 and 8 are absent: a tab and a newline have no source
! syntax, so no stroke reaches them.
!buffer the quick brown fox
^AP
!buffer hello world
^AP
!buffer one
^AP
!buffer ALL CAPS here
^AP
!buffer Already Capped Words
^AP
!buffer mixedCase getUserName HTTPServer
^AP
!buffer kebab-case snake_case dotted.name
^AP
!buffer wrapped (already) here
^AP
!buffer hello (there world)
^AP
!buffer trailing punctuation, and more.
^AP
!buffer x1 y2 z3
^AP
!buffer a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s
^AP
!buffer quoted "thing" here
^AP
!buffer the end
^AP
